 <h3><u>Hawa par</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Pabandi lagaye koi be peer hawa par..(2)<br> Karti hai safar midhat e shabbir hawa par</p> 
  <p>1. Mashriq ki hawaen kabhi maghrib me na aati..(2)<br> Gar khenchta ghaazi khate shamsheer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
  <p>2. Ab sirf mai paani pe bharosa na karunga..(2)<br> Karna hai areeza mujhe tehreer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
  <p>3. Tab jaake hui hai wo kahi chalne ke qabil..(2)<br> Jab naam e ali hogaya tehreer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
  <p>4. Dhundho na zamee par na mili hai na milegi..(2)<br> Asghar ke kafe paa ki hai tasweer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
  <p>5. Usqut jo kaha hogai khamosh khudai..(2)<br> Qabza hai tera shaah ki hamsheer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
  <p>6. Jo zarf me kaghaz ke samata nahi sajjad..(2)<br> wo sher mai kar deta hu tehreer hawa par<br> Pabandi lagaye..</p> 
